==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Doge Base]].
*5 [[Wafer Cat XL (Enemy)|Wafer Cat XL]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 95% HP:
**10 [[Snowball]]s spawn as bosses, delay 0.07~0.33 seconds<sup>2f~10f</sup>.
**1 [[Snowball]] spawns as the boss.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Snowball]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Wafer Cat XL (Enemy)|Wafer Cat XL]]s spawn, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 85% HP:
**1 [[Snowball]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Ice Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage can easily be rushed as the enemies are quite weak with Wafer Cat BIG dealing essentially no damage. Bring [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] and a few meatshields for an easy victory.

